            <ArticleTitle>Formal total synthesis of the akuammiline alkaloid (+)-strictamine.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>12665-12667</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1039/c7cc08153g</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>An asymmetric formal total synthesis of the akuammiline alkaloid (+)-strictamine is reported. The key features of the synthesis include a Friedel-Crafts cyclization to form the D-ring and the critical C7 all-carbon quaternary carbon centre, as well as an aza-1,6-conjugate addition to assemble the 2-azabicyclo[3.3.1]nonane system.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
